t": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Marco, can you pass me that scarf and my keys, please?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Here you go. Should I bring a jacket?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Probably. You're Australian, aren't you? It's been chilly in the evenings.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Anything under 20 degrees is cool for me."}, {"time": "14000", "image": "engenn6le12ob04re2img09.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We need to get a park close to the restaurant.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Why? Are you scared of a little walking?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, but I haven't walked in these high heels before.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I haven't seen those ones before ... they're nice.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Aww ... that's sweet. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Ok,  now you're blushing like a school girl. Let's get going."}, {"time": "33200", "image": "engenn6le12ob04re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The hockey is still on. Can you turn off the television, too?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hey, the Maple Leafs just scored. It's a tied game.  We'll have to leave in a bit.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey, hold on. We have a reservation and the traffic is abhorrent this time of night. We've got to leave now!"}, {"time": "49000", "image": "engenn6le12ob04re2img07.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Wow, this is like lacrosse! I've played that before.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Marco, you have five minutes. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Are there any cold drinks in the fridge?"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_op