ntion using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le12ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Reduced and Unreduced forms of Have "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the reduced and unreduced forms of <span class=\"strong\">to have</span> in conversations. </p>Look at the chart below."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I haven't walked in these high heels before."}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's been chilly at night."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Unreduced Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Reduced Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He has / She has / It has\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He's / She's / It's\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We've\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You've\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "S + consonant sound combinations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Blends are combinations of two or three consonants that are voiced.</br> The following are examples: </br>Fl, bl, sl, cl, pl, bl, gr, tr, br, cr, dr, pr, fr, wh, str, sw, sp, sc, sn, sm, sk"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some examples of words with the sc consonant blend.</p> scared, score, scarf, screw"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Please pass me my scarf."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you scared of horror films?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chilly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "noticeably cold"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's been chilly in the evenings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le12ob04aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a conversation between two people."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to blush"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to become red in your face because you are ashamed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Now you are making me blush!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le12ob04aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "like a school girl"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to behave in a childish way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Stop acting like a school girl."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le12ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to score"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get points, goals, or runs in a game or contest"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Maple Leafs just scored in the hockey game."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le12ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "abhorrent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing or deserving strong dislike or hatred"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have a reservation and the traffic is abhorrent this time of night."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le12ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Interview your partner. Ask five questions. Find out what what sporting activities they have done and haven't done in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use three words with the consonant blend sc like <span class=\"italic\">scared</span>, <span class=\"italic\">scored</span>, <span class=\"italic\">school</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down your partner's answers in complete sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I interview a partner about the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use words with the consonant blend sc in a sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my dialogue about what I have done to a partner."}]}]}